
==============================================================================
A. Constants of the Lemma 6.4 mechanism (exact)
==============================================================================
gamma := 2 arcsin(1/(2 sqrt 3))
  cos(gamma)      = cos(2*asin(sqrt(3)/6))    [paper: 5/6]  ok: True
  sin(gamma)      = sin(2*asin(sqrt(3)/6))  = sqrt(11)/6 ? True
  |1-exp(i gamma)|= sqrt(3)/3  = 1/sqrt3 ? True
  triangle side   = 1  = 1 ? True
  gamma/pi irrational: gamma/pi rational => exp(i gamma) a root of unity =>
  2cos(gamma)=5/3 a rational algebraic integer => an integer: contradiction.
  summands nonparallel: angular difference pi+gamma is not a multiple of pi.

